          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Old clothes, sturdy shoes and a water bottle. "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "We provide tools, safety gear and lunch.",
